DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260920T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260920T120000
SUMMARY:Atheist chat at the Whole Foods cafe on South Tunnel Road
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Atheists\nPlease visit with us **Sunday Sept 20** to
  chat with like-minded people. We're meeting **once a month on Sunday morn
 ings**. Mark your calendar for **Sept 20 and October 18.**\n(If you *think
 * you might come\, please mark **Attend** below\; that helps us know how m
 any tables to put together.)\n\nOur great new location is **the cafe upsta
 irs** at **Whole Foods\, 4 South Tunnel Road (across from the mall).** The
 y have coffee and a lot more. Maybe you have shopping you want to do at Wh
 ole Foods or one of the other businesses on Tunnel Road before or after th
 e meeting.\n\n**We start at 10am and end at noon**\, but you're welcome to
  arrive or leave according to your own schedule.\n\nIf some folks want to 
 have serious conversations about religion and/or atheism\, while others ju
 st want to chat about other things\, we'll use two sets of tables.\n\n**We
  hope *you* stop by**. You can also feel free to tell other non-believers 
 about our meetups - they are welcome too.\n\nIf you have other times\, loc
 ations or activities to suggest for the future\, please email them to pete
 rthorwarth@gmail.com Thanks!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/atheistsofwnc/events/316413888/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260904T070624Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260904T070624Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Shutupandwriteasheville": "https://www.meetup.com/shutupandwriteasheville/events/316240344/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_shutupandwriteasheville
X-SOURCE:Shut Up & Write Western NC
UID:event_316240344@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260919T042023Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260920T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260920T120000
SUMMARY:Shut Up & Write - South Asheville 
DESCRIPTION:Shut Up & Write!® Western North Carolina\nCoworking for write
 rs in your area!\nJoin us for some focused writing time. All writers and a
 ll experience levels are welcome and don’t worry\, no one will see what 
 you've written. This session is about getting your writing done and meetin
 g other writers in your area.\n\nPlease arrive a few minutes early to say 
 hello to everyone\, grab a drink\, and get your writing tools ready. Once 
 everyone’s arrived\, I will lead quick introductions and then set the ti
 mer for our quiet and focused writing session.\n\nAfterward\, we’ll have
  time to chat and get to know each other. We often talk about our successe
 s and challenges as writers. If you don’t have time to stick around\, no
  worries!\n\nA note about the format\nWe don’t host critiques or reading
 s. These events are a safe space for writers of all skill levels and genre
 s to work on their craft\, so no one will read or critique your writing.\n
