 -13/948e46e8-3ea3-4775-a300-99fe658db8b6.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The realest-deal storyteller in indie-rock today is the Tampa-
 born\, New Orleans-based singer/songwriter **Thomas Dollbaum**\, and Birds
  of Paradise is his most powerful and dynamic work yet. Following up his c
 ritically acclaimed Wellswood (Big Legal Mess\, 2022) and Drive All Night 
 EP (Dear Life Records\, 2025)\, Birds of Paradise is a goodbye letter to l
 ost loved ones and former selves. These songs find Dollbaum searching for 
 acceptance in the transient in-between places: Florida’s pine flatwoods\
 , 
LOCATION:Static Age Records\, 110 North Lexington Avenue\, Asheville\, Nor
 th Carolina 28801\, United States
URL:https://link.dice.fm/j36ed9d39fd8
