BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Ncarboretum": "https://ncarboretum.org/event/fall-ecology-walk-2/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ncarboretum
X-SOURCE:NC Arboretum
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261009T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261009T150000
DTSTAMP:20260819T173402Z
CREATED:20260819T173402Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260819T173402Z
UID:1778780019773-1791552600-1791558000@ncarboretum.org
SUMMARY:Fall Ecology Walk
DESCRIPTION:Fall Ecology Walk\nwith Dan Lazar \nFriday\, October 9  |  1:30 – 3pm \nBRN – Core  |  BREG – Core \nRegister Here!\n  \nParticipants will walk through the garden and then head into the Arboretum Forest on easily accessible trails. Along the way we’ll take in autumn wildflowers and the changing hues on autumn’s rich palette of colors apparent on the diverse species of our native trees. We’ll learn how each autumn in Southern Appalachia is different\, due in part to this biological diversity and changing climate conditions over the course of the year. \nThis program takes place in the classroom and outdoors. Please come prepared to walk on gentle\, yet uneven terrain\, and dress appropriately for the weather. \nDan Lazar served for many years as the director of education at the Western North Carolina Nature Center\, followed by several years as executive director of the Colburn Earth Science Museum. Dan has a degree in forest biology from the State University of New York College of Environmental Science and Forestry and has been an instructor in the Blue Ridge Naturalist program since 2005. \n●  Members: Remember to enter your promo code upon checkout to receive your 10% member discount! Email adulteducation@ncarboretum.org with questions. \n●  See a full listing of Adult Education Programs at the North Carolina Arboretum here! Questions? Check our FAQs. \n●  We are committed to fostering a diverse\, supportive learning community. If the cost of a class is a barrier for you\, please complete this scholarship form and we will see what kind of assistance we can provide. \n●  Follow us on Facebook & Instagram! \n●  Join our Adult Education Student Hub on Discord! \n●  Interested in supporting the NC Arboretum more directly? Donate to the ONE Fund here. \nSee all of our classes open for registration here!
URL:https://ncarboretum.org/event/fall-ecology-walk-2/
CATEGORIES:Adult Education,BREG,BRN
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ncarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Phenology-seasonal.png
END:VEVENT
