 eal with Epic in the 90s with his band “Hand of Fate.” John has played
  with people from the Red Hot Chili Peppers\, Pearl Jam and Smashing Pumpk
 ins. His earlier stuff was Alternative Rock. John stopped playing music ov
 er 25 years ago\, but started writing songs and playing again in 2018. Joh
 n’s music is influenced by Tom Petty\, Led Zepplin\, The Rolling Stones\
 , David Bowie\, Pink Floyd and The Beatles. His band\, John Keck Band is p
 laying in the Asheville area.\n\n\n\nMusic 8:30-11:30pm $10 cover at the d
