DESCRIPTION:Taoist Tai Chiis a moving meditation that reduces stress and h
 elps one feel energetic\, balanced\, strong\, and flexible.Taoist Tai Chi 
 Schedule UpdatesAs Taoist Tai Chi continues to grow at the Weaverville Com
 munity Center\, we want to share a few schedule updates. The Tuesday Integ
