DESCRIPTION:APLR Presents: **Ak'chamel** Friday\, November 6th\, 2026 Ayur
 Prana Listening Room - 312 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28806 Doors 6PM || 
 Show 7PM **Ak'chamel** For 15 years Ak’chamel has built a solid reputati
 on as a compelling stage project. Wearing nightmarish costumes and engagin
 g in hallucinatory “rituals”\, their singular sound comprising desert-
 scorched psychedelia\, post-apocalyptic shamanism\, and lo-fi ritual-folk 
 is as unique as the physical theater of their live performances.
