DESCRIPTION:Eulogy Presents: Scattrbrain Thu\, November 19th\, 2026 Eulogy
  - 10 Buxton Ave. Asheville\, NC 28801 Doors 7PM || Show 8PM **Scattrbrain
 ** Scattrbrain is the full-band alter ego of Atlanta-based artist GRIP\, t
 he acclaimed rapper and songwriter known for his gritty lyricism\, sharp s
 ocial commentary and raw emotional depth. After emerging from Atlanta’s 
 hip-hop underground and signing with Eminem’s Shady Records\, GRIP creat
 ed Scattrbrain as a new outlet for experimentation\, rebellion and reinven
 tion.
